				<title>श्राद्धम्</title>
				<link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/paravastu-sAma/shrAddham/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/paravastu-sAma/shrAddham/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;../devaH/indraH/archata-prArchata/&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;../devaH/agniH/IDiShva/&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;../devaH/somaH/pavamAna/&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;true&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;../devaH/somaH/abhi-vAyum-pArtham/&#34;&gt;&#xA;### ऋक्&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;3&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_sAma/kauthumam/saMhitA/vishvAsa-prastutiH/4_uttarArchikaH/6/2/18-1_1426_abhi_vAyum.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h3&gt;18-1_1426 अभि वायुम् ...{Loading}...&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;अ꣣भि꣢ वा꣣युं꣢ वी꣣꣬त्य꣢꣯र्षा गृणा꣣नो꣢꣣ऽ. ऽभि꣣ मि꣣त्रा꣡वरु꣢꣯णा पू꣣य꣡मा꣢नः। अ꣣भी꣡ नरं꣢꣯ धी꣣ज꣡व꣢नꣳ रथे꣣ष्ठा꣢म꣣भी꣢न्द्रं꣣ वृ꣡ष꣢णं꣣ व꣡ज्र꣢बाहुम् ॥ 18-1:1426 ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; title=&#34;विश्वास-शाकल-प्रस्तुतिः&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/vedAH_sAma/vedAH_Rk/shAkalam/saMhitA/vishvAsa-prastutiH/09/097/49_abhi_vAyuM.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;विश्वास-शाकल-प्रस्तुतिः ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;अभि᳓ वायुं᳓ वीत्य्+++((त्यै)=पानाय)+++ अ᳙र्षा+++(=गच्छ)+++  गृणानो᳙+++(=स्तूयमानः)+++&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ऽभि᳓ मित्रा᳓व᳓रुणा पूय᳓मानः ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अभी᳓ न᳓रं+++(=नेतारं)+++ धीज᳓वनं+++(=धीजवं)+++  रथेष्ठा᳓म्+++(अश्वियुग्मम्)+++ अभी᳓न्द्रं वृ᳓षणं व᳓ज्रबाहुम् ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;  &#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;सम&#34;&gt;साम&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div caption=&#34;गोपालार्यः 2015  &#34; class=&#34;audioEmbed&#34; src=&#34;https://archive&#xA;.org/download/jaiminIya-sAma-gAna-paravastu-tradition-gopAla-2015/abhi-vAyuM-pArdham.mp3&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;पार्थम् ॥&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ओ+++([])+++,ओहो, ओहोइ ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अ+++([])+++भि वायुं ।  वी+++([])+++,इतीया । षा+++([])+++गृणानाहा ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अ+++([])+++भिमित्रा । वा+++([])+++रूणा । पू+++([])+++यामानाहा ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अ+++([])+++भी, नरां ।  धी+++([])+++,इजावा । णङ्+++([])+++राधेष्टाअं ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अ+++([])+++भिइंद्राम् ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;वृ+++([])+++षाणं । वा+++([])+++अअ,ज्रा,अ,बाअ,हुंङुं,ङूउम् ॥ ७ ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
